graph TD
    A[Acetyl-CoA Availability] --> B[HMG-CoA Synthase]
    B --> C[HMG-CoA Formation]
    C --> D[HMG-CoA Reductase]
    D --> E[Mevalonate Production]
    E --> F[Isoprenoid Synthesis]
    F --> G[Squalene Formation]
    G --> H[Lanosterol Formation]
    H --> I[Cholesterol Synthesis]
    I --> J[Sterol Synthesis Complete]
    
    %% Alternative pathway
    A --> K[Non-mevalonate Pathway]
    K --> L[Isopentenyl Pyrophosphate]
