    N -->|Yes| O[Synthesis Inhibition]
    N -->|No| P[Synthesis Activation]
    
    %% Key proteins
    Q[HMG-CoA Synthase] --> B
    R[HMG-CoA Reductase] --> D
    S[Squalene Synthase] --> G
    T[Lanosterol Synthase] --> H
    U[Cholesterol Synthase] --> I
    V[HMG-CoA] --> C
    W[Mevalonate] --> E
    X[Squalene] --> G
    Y[Lanosterol] --> H
    Z[Cholesterol] --> I
    
